<view class="container">
  <view class="card hero">
    <view class="hero-title">🌸 气血 & 脑疲劳专项</view>
    <view class="hero-desc">专门为你设计的：气血不足、容易叹气、用脑过度</view>
    <view class="hero-count">今日完成 {{doneCount}}/{{items.length}}</view>
  </view>

  <view
    wx:for="{{items}}" wx:key="id"
    class="card qiqi-card {{item.done ? 'qiqi-done' : ''}}"
  >
    <view class="qiqi-head" bindtap="toggleSteps" data-idx="{{index}}">
      <view class="qiqi-main">
        <text class="qiqi-icon">{{item.icon}}</text>
        <view>
          <view class="qiqi-title">{{item.title}}</view>
          <view class="qiqi-time">{{item.time}}</view>
        </view>
      </view>
      <view class="qiqi-check {{item.done ? 'checked' : ''}}" catchtap="toggle" data-id="{{item.id}}">
        <text wx:if="{{item.done}}">✓</text>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="qiqi-desc">{{item.desc}}</view>

    <view class="qiqi-steps" wx:if="{{item.expanded}}">
      <view class="steps-title">怎么做：</view>
      <view class="step-item" wx:for="{{item.steps}}" wx:for-item="s" wx:key="*this">
        · {{s}}
      </view>
    </view>
    <view class="expand-hint" wx:if="{{!item.expanded}}">点这里看具体做法 ▾</view>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="section-title">为什么会叹气？</view>
    <view class="explain">
      中医讲"叹气 = 肝郁气滞"，现代医学看是<text class="hl">过度换气+情绪压抑</text>的表现。
      长期脑疲劳、久坐、熬夜都会加重。不是矫情，是身体在发信号——
      <text class="hl">深呼吸 + 按揉太冲穴 + 规律作息</text>，比任何补品都管用。
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
